flowchart TD
    A[Public source-guided scenario] --> B[Static retrieval or bounded controller]
    B --> C[Same final K and text budget]
    D[Private evaluator requirements] --> E[Three blinded bundle judges]
    C --> E
    E --> F{Material disagreement?}
    F -->|yes| G[Independent adjudication]
    F -->|no| H[Silver bundle sufficiency]
    G --> H
    C --> I[Same answer generator]
    I --> J[Three blinded answer judges]
    K[Verified independent source excerpts] --> J
    C --> L[Union of all systems' passages]
    L --> M[Three blinded passage judges]
    M --> N[Pooled nDCG and pointwise diagnostics]
    H --> O[Paired scenario-level results and cost]
    J --> O
    N --> O
    D -. never supplied .-> X[Runtime controller has no answer key]
